        "title": "Rhythm and Meter",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Mathematical structure:** Rhythm is about **rational relationships** between durations. A triplet is a 3:2 ratio. Polyrhythm is simultaneous different subdivisions. Metric modulation is a tempo change defined by a precise ratio."
    },
