      "text": "```\nTIME SIGNATURE FORMAT:\n    3   ← numerator: beats per measure (or subdivisions)\n    4   ← denominator: note value that gets one beat (4 = quarter note)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RHYTHM-METER.md#008",
      "path": [
        "03-RHYTHM-METER.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
