        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Rhythm and Meter",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SIMPLE METER: top number = beats per bar\n  2/4: strong-weak          (march, polka)\n  3/4: strong-weak-weak     (waltz, minuet)\n  4/4: strong-weak-semi-weak (most music)\n  2/2 (alla breve \"¢\"): half note gets beat, faster feel than 2/4"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RHYTHM-METER.md#009",
      "path": [
        "03-RHYTHM-METER.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:music-theory:03-rhythm-meter, git-history:music-theory:03-rhythm-meter]",
