        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Rhythm and Meter",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Key test: how does it feel in performance?\n  6/8 at slow tempo → counted as 6 (1-2-3-4-5-6)\n  6/8 at fast tempo → counted as 2 (ONE-and-a-TWO-and-a)\n  The \"beat unit\" at fast 6/8 is the dotted quarter (♩.)\n```"
    },
