      },
      "text": "In compound meter, the beat unit is ALWAYS a dotted note:\n  6/8  → beat = ♩.  (dotted quarter)\n  6/4  → beat = ♩.. (dotted half)\n  9/8  → beat = ♩.  (dotted quarter, 3 per bar)\n```"
